        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to Aaron, “Say to the whole congregation of the people of Israel, ‘Come near before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", for he has heard your murmurings.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as Aaron spoke to the whole congregation of the people of Israel, they looked toward the wilderness, and behold, the glory of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared in the cloud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have heard the murmurings of the people of Israel; say to them, ‘At twilight you shall eat flesh, and in the morning you shall be filled with bread; then you shall know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the evening quails came up and covered the camp; and in the morning dew lay round about the camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the dew had gone up, there was on the face of the wilderness a fine, flake-like thing, fine as hoarfrost on the ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the people of Israel saw it, they said to one another, “What is it?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“It is manna.”",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "man hu",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For they did not know what it was. And Moses said to them, “It is the bread which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has given you to eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded: ‘Gather of it, every man of you, as much as he can eat; you shall take an omer apiece, according to the number of the persons whom each of you has in his tent.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people of Israel did so; they gathered, some more, some less. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 8.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But when they measured it with an omer, he that gathered much had nothing over, and he that gathered little had no lack; each gathered according to what he could eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to them, “Let no man leave any of it till the morning.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they did not listen to Moses; some left part of it till the morning, and it bred worms and became foul; and Moses was angry with them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morning by morning they gathered it, each as much as he could eat; but when the sun grew hot, it melted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the sixth day they gathered twice as much bread, two omers apiece; and when all the leaders of the congregation came and told Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said to them, “This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded: ‘Tomorrow is a day of solemn rest, a holy sabbath to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; bake what you will bake and boil what you will boil, and all that is left over lay by to be kept till the morning.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they laid it by till the morning, as Moses bade them; and it did not become foul, and there were no worms in it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said, “Eat it today, for today is a sabbath to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; today you will not find it in the field. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Six days you shall gather it; but on the seventh day, which is a sabbath, there will be none.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the seventh day some of the people went out to gather, and they found none. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “How long do you refuse to keep my commandments and my laws? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See! The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has given you the sabbath, therefore on the sixth day he gives you bread for two days; remain every man of you in his place, let no man go out of his place on the seventh day.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the people rested on the seventh day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the house of Israel called its name manna; it was like coriander seed, white, and the taste of it was like wafers made with honey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said, “This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded: ‘Let an omer of it be kept throughout your generations, that they may see the bread with which I fed you in the wilderness, when I brought you out of the land of Egypt.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to Aaron, “Take a jar, and put an omer of manna in it, and place it before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to be kept throughout your generations.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded Moses, so Aaron placed it before the testimony, to be kept. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people of Israel ate the manna forty years, till they came to a habitable land; they ate the manna, till they came to the border of the land of Canaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(An omer is the tenth part of an ephah.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
